  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kgPmdbHD/lios-seafaring-dungeons.png\" alt=\"lios-seafaring-dungeons\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎來到 <strong>Lio's Seafaring Dungeons</strong>！此模組為您的 Minecraft 世界新增了多種新型地牢，無論是水下還是地下。您會發現充滿自訂戰利品、具有挑戰性的敵人的獨特結構，以及等待征服的 Boss 房間。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pBZGPGy1/dungeon-types.png\" alt=\"dungeon-types\" width=\"464\" height=\"38\"></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>苔蘚海洋地牢</strong> – 這些地牢生成於較溫暖的海洋氣候中</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>砂岩海洋地牢</strong> – 發現於較寒冷的海洋氣候中</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>地下陸地地牢</strong> – 在地表下方發現的巨大而延伸的地牢</li>\n</ul><div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基於資料包的設定嗎？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">查看 <strong>LioLoader</strong> 以進行全域資料包/資源包載入。適用於 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong> 的 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 版本。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">在 CurseForge 上開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n</div>\n</a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/xiKHo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gFGT7zG/bisecthosting.png\" alt=\"bisecthosting\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xhst1_TfmcE?start=1117\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E-ycJzZalDg\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsPHes7q4Pr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"usageinmodpacks\" width=\"602\" height=\"41\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br></strong>此模組可自由使用於任何整合包中，無需許可。隨意將它包含在任何地方，盡情享受 Lio's Seafaring Dungeons 所提供的一切吧！</p>",
